# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Nothing here is required yet. The app runs on the in-memory data provider in
# src/lib/data, so `pnpm dev` works with no .env.local at all.
#
# When the local Supabase stack is set up, uncomment these. Both values are
# printed by `supabase start` and by `supabase status`.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-local-anon-key-here
